    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwiza kwa ngomi ntaale",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū badūgū, ū mhayo gwa kūshoka kwa ng'wa Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito, na a bise ū kwibilinga kūlī wei, tūlīmulomba ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mutizūlelengetiwa wangū wangū ū mu maganiko ging'we. Na hangī yaya ū kūzwanjiwa nūūlū na moyo nebe. Nūūlū īkabiza mihayo ya mbika kī, nūūlū yūbiza nyalūba īlīhayiwa angū yafumile kū bise, īlīyomba gīkī ū lūshikū lo ng'wa Seeba lwamalile kūshika! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munhū ose ose atizūmulemba nūūlū hado; nguno shiigelile tame wilonge būkenaagūji būtaale, na ngomi ntaale iyooleche ha ng'wape. Ū wei alī ng'wana wa kūyagala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyo ashilemile būlī shikolo īsho shikitanagwa mulungu, nūūlū īsho shikalamiagwa. Nīyo akwigūngūhya higūlya ya shose shenīsho. Nū mu hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu akūja akigashe, kūnū akwigīmbaga gīkī ū wei hū Mulungu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī mutizūkīlaga gīkī aho naalī hamò ning'we nakamuwīla ī mihayo yenīyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī haha mushimanile īsho shihangīgije, kūshisha līshike ī likanza lya kwiyoolecha kwakwe ha ng'wape. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ahene nūūlū ī haha ū būgomi būlīho būkūtūmamaga; alīyo mu mbika ya mbisīla, nguno shitaalī shilīho īsho shihangīgije. Ūlū shilīnjiwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akwiyoolecha ha ng'wape ū ngomi ng'wenūyo. Alīyo ū Seeba Yesu akūnkenaagūla bo myūyī ya mu nomo gokwe, anyagaje n'ikūjo lya kūshoka gokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kwiza kwa ngomi ng'wenūyo kūkwiyoolecha mu būdūla bose bo katūmamīle ka ng'wa Shetani, na mihayo mitaale ya kūkamaaja kūlwa kūlemba lemba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na mu mbika jose ja mihayo yabūbi, ya kongeja kūbajimīīja a bajimīīji, nguno batatogilwe ū kwīyanukūla ī ng'hana gīkī bapījiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa nguno yenīyo ū Mulungu akūbatūmīlaga nguzu jabūbi, bayūzunya ya būlomolomo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gīko abo batīzunije ī ng'hana, abo bakayejiagwa na mihayo yabūbi, bakūgwīlwa nsango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abo babalīlilwe būpīji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo badūgū batogwa ba ng'wa Seeba, a bise shitwigeleelilwe kūnūmba Mulungu gwa gwa gwa kūlwa nguno ying'we, īkī ū Mulungu wamusola kūfuma ha wandījo gīkī mupījiwe mu nzīla ya kwejiwa na Moyo, na kūlwa kwīzunya ī ng'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akang'witana mu nzīla ya Ng'hūlū Jawiza ījo tūkūjilomeelaga, gīkī ng'wanukūle ikūjo lya ng'wa Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ī haha badūgū, handatīlagi, ng'wīdime ī mihayo īyo ng'wamala kūlangwa mu nzīla ya būlomeeji wise, nūūlū mu nyalūba jise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu Kilisito, ū Seeba wise ng'wenekīlī nū Mulungu Sīswe ūyo atūtogilwe, ūyo hangī wamala kūtwinha būlūngūjiwa butashilaga, hamò na kwisagīlwa kwawiza kūlwa shigongo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "leki ayīlūngūje ī myoyo ying'we, hangī amuguzuhye mu kalūngalūngīle na mu katūmamīle kose, ako kalī kawiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
